gin":"radcortez","id":5796305,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3OTYzMDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5796305?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/radcortez","html_url":"https://github.com/radcortez","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radcortez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radcortez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radcortez/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radcortez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radcortez/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radcortez/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radcortez/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radcortez/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radcortez/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-25T17:45:15Z","updated_at":"2025-02-25T17:45:26Z","body":"Ah, I see.\n\nThe `@WithConverter` annotation is for `@ConfigMapping` as:\n\n```java\n@ConfigMapping(prefix = \"map\")\ninterface MapMapping {\n    @WithConverter(MapConverter.class)\n    Map<String, String> value();\n}\n```\n\nIt does not work with `@ConfigProperty`. \n\nWe already provide an out-of-the-box converter for `Map`, but it uses a slightly different format (as you can see in the error message). The expected format is `<key1>=<value1>;<key2>=<value2>...` instead of `<key>:<value>,...`.\n\nYou can override the default Map converter like this and give it a higher priority:\nhttps://smallrye.io/smallrye-config/3.11.4/converters/custom/","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/comments/2682833185/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"radcortez","id":5796305,"no